                         MMDDYYYY(DATE1)
                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       VALIDATE-TAX-BAND-1384.
               UNSTRING WS-KEY-CHAR DELIMITED BY '/'
                             INTO WS-KEY-CUSTOMER
